165-- The long staircase: stand at (13,5,12), climb south to (13,8,16), keep climbing to (13,12,20). Nothing may be placed on x13 z12..20
166-  in y5..15 except the stairs, and nothing at (13,1..3,14..18).
167-- The top floor has no ceiling: the roof's underside is its ceiling. P2 must not fill the attic.
168-- Room designers: walls, floors, windows and doors are done; place furniture only into air, never in a doorway, a window cell, a stair
169-  or stair-hole cell; keep a 1-wide path from every door to the room's middle. Light every room (lanterns, candles, end rods).

